Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:09.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.61,0:00:11.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人氣偶像琴美結婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:14.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在花雨中漫步而來的動人模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.83,0:00:17.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可謂是幸福的象徵
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.55,0:00:21.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其結婚對象是就讀於市內某大學的普通男性
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:26.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,兩人收到了政府選出結婚對象的「政府通知」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:28.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,終於在這良辰吉日 共結良緣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,超·少子化對策基本法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:39.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,俗稱「姻緣法」實施後約40年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:43.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這個國家的男女在滿16週歲時
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.14,0:00:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,會收到政府所指定的將來的結婚對象的通知
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.30,0:00:49.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,並禁止與除該對像以外的人戀愛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在這一政策下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.97,0:00:53.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,少子化現象得到緩解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.80,0:00:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出生的後代與以前相比能力也有所提升
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.44,0:01:02.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因此這個由政府通知決定的「婚姻」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.06,0:01:04.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被稱為能在遺傳學角度保證人類幸福的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.49,0:01:08.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,「科學的紅線」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.52,0:01:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然而 卻出現了一位對此政策抱有不滿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.05,0:01:26.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,極其普通的 墜入愛河的少年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.26,0:01:41.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真っ赤な線を描いたちっぽけな心の話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.64,0:01:47.83,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僕らの未来はどこに向かって光るの
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:54.80,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,続きの線を描いた　色づいてしまう度にまぶしい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.29,0:02:00.36,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,そんな心のリズムを繋ぎだす
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.18,0:02:07.77,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,かなしいかなしいかなしいかなしい
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.84,0:02:14.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,うれしいうれしいうれしいうれしい
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:21.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,２つの感情に揺さぶられては
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.57,0:02:28.45,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,まだ見ぬ指先を照らし出してくだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.32,0:02:36.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,このまま嘘でもいいから夢泳がせて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:42.01,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,かなしいかなしい今を探してく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:49.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僕らは見えない未来を信じてる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:54.69,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,だから悲しい悲しい今を探しては光った
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.44,0:02:56.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,引つかた
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.28,0:03:04.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在教室裡 我的目光總是忍不住追隨著她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.14,0:03:07.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為了避兔被她發現
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.02,0:03:09.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總是悄悄地看著她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.78,0:03:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,於是我忍不住會想
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.16,0:03:16.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,「喜歡」是種什麼樣的感覺呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:20.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人們何時會掉進這個陷阱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.12,0:03:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我跟你說 小根
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.91,0:03:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.96,0:03:30.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想談戀愛了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:32.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是 是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.88,0:03:34.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就去談啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要為戀愛而活
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.83,0:03:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要我活著就要去戀愛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才不要結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.76,0:03:47.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪 竹田是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.89,0:03:52.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那傢伙 說昨天他收到了政府通知
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.10,0:03:52.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.43,0:03:55.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然後明天就要去相親了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:55.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他現在害怕得不行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.96,0:03:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才沒害怕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.31,0:04:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只是想要忠於自己的內心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.65,0:04:03.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,別找借口 了你只是想做愛而已吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.82,0:04:05.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,才不是 是愛好嗎 是愛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:09.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你覺得和政府安排的對象之間會有愛嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.74,0:04:12.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總之我要在此起誓
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:14.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要談戀愛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.70,0:04:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,絕對不和政府決定的對象結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.83,0:04:21.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也明白你的心情 竹田
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.25,0:04:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,確實是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.13,0:04:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,強制將我們塞進結婚這種如男人墳墓的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:29.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這不是很奇怪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.68,0:04:33.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你們幾個都在起誓吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.72,0:04:34.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為了表明我們的決心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:39.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們絕對不結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:45.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高 高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.49,0:04:48.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 女生不能加入吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.32,0:04:51.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 沒有那種事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.49,0:04:53.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你為什麼要說敬語啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.58,0:04:55.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.37,0:04:59.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學真可愛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果政府通知的對象是高崎同學就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:05.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學4月就16歲了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:05.73,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什麼 什麼 你和仁阪同學說了些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.73,0:05:06.94,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.07,0:05:08.11,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美咲太狡猾了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.11,0:05:09.61,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,絢乃也去聊聊不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:07.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是好像還沒有收到政府通知呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.38,0:05:09.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.68,0:05:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我也還沒有過生日
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.72,0:05:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的對象也有可能是高崎同學了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.93,0:05:16.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我和小根也有可能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.02,0:05:18.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.39,0:05:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 高崎同學的政府通知應該快到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.61,0:05:31.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這是什麼世道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:35.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不想和自己不喜歡的人結婚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.01,0:05:35.47,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剛學後去卡拉OK怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.47,0:05:36.14,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.35,0:05:38.02,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就去車站那邊那家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.87,0:05:37.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,政府通知啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.63,0:05:46.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被保證的幸福 安定的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.46,0:05:50.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然聽起來很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.01,0:05:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我卻不想接受安排啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.35,0:05:58.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想談戀愛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.89,0:05:59.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想去表白
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.52,0:06:02.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想對高崎同學表白
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:14.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管別人怎麼想 我一定要表白
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.20,0:06:18.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要告訴她 這五年來我一直都喜歡她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.18,0:06:44.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這個分你一半
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.46,0:07:04.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.54,0:07:10.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝你 謝謝你 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.88,0:07:17.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僅僅是這麼簡單的一句話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:21.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她就緊緊抓住了我的心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.18,0:07:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 和她的交流也就只有這麼一次
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:37.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 我一直難以忘懷那時她的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.00,0:07:45.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,後天就是你的生日了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.17,0:07:47.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,說起來也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:49.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.13,0:07:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,會來嗎 政府通知
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:55.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想應該要來了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.48,0:07:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,當天下午就會送到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.09,0:07:58.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哎呀 我有點激動呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.14,0:08:01.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥 要結婚啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.08,0:08:04.00,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定能找到好對象的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.04,0:08:06.87,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是為了這個才給你取名由佳吏(姻緣)啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.68,0:08:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 我的通知也要來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:08.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是一旦通知來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.60,0:08:10.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的結婚對象就會定下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:13.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就會被禁止和他人談戀愛了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:15.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,會是怎樣的對象呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:17.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是令人期待呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.25,0:08:18.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,令人期待
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.72,0:08:23.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要 我不要這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.26,0:08:27.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只喜歡高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.35,0:08:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,從以前到現在我一直喜歡她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.73,0:08:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是現在說不定高崎同學的通知就來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.82,0:08:46.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也許明天 我的通知說不定也會來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.66,0:08:48.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒有時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.79,0:08:50.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果現在不說的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.25,0:08:53.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明天一早 一定要說出口
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.29,0:08:56.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要拿出勇氣來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:00.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高 高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.72,0:09:05.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,早 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.30,0:09:08.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能借一步說話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.72,0:09:11.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.56,0:09:14.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉你們先去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.02,0:09:18.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美咲 難道又要被告白了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.27,0:09:21.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這個月的第二次 不 是第三次了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.57,0:09:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 我 我叫根島
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.28,0:09:31.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小學的時候 曾經和你是同班同學
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.79,0:09:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.21,0:09:38.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你 你不記得了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.88,0:09:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是幾年級的時候呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.67,0:09:43.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,班主任是誰呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.05,0:09:45.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這 這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.55,0:09:47.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎 怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.05,0:09:49.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我該說什麼 完全不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.85,0:09:52.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那 你找我有什麼事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.81,0:09:55.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒事 沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:57.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,耽誤你時間了 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.31,0:10:00.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎 那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.20,0:10:10.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,果然也這樣了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.37,0:10:14.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對我來說如此特別的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.12,0:10:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,卻不曾在高崎同學的記憶中留下痕跡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.97,0:10:27.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天下午六點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.88,0:10:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在小學後面的公園裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.39,0:10:32.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,請來一下吧 我等你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:39.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果可以的話 我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.90,0:10:42.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我大概會一直等下去的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:11:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學 好慢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.54,0:11:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她在幹什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:07.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一想到根島同學 就心跳加速
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.25,0:11:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以才遲到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.92,0:11:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是她這麼說的話我該怎麼辦 怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.35,0:11:20.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,八點半了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.74,0:11:29.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行啊 等得心都碎了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.99,0:11:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:39.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.58,0:11:41.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已經十點半了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:42.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,警察
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.21,0:11:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.79,0:11:46.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我光顧著做沙雕古墳忘記時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我馬上就回去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.17,0:11:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沙雕古墳
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.84,0:11:52.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回去的路上要小心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.34,0:11:53.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.81,0:12:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,說到底我還未成年啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.72,0:12:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.38,0:12:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.72,0:12:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 對不起 我遲到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.85,0:12:41.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 不會
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.77,0:12:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一直吸引著我目光的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.56,0:12:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,現在在我的面前
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.07,0:12:49.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我卻不知道該說些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.08,0:13:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.17,0:13:06.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是古墳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.67,0:13:09.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 是先方後圓墳
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:11.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在教科書上也有記載
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.26,0:13:12.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它是最具代表的古墳
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.22,0:13:16.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我個人還是喜歡邊上的四角突出墳
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.47,0:13:19.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過堆得最好的應該是中間雙方中圓墳
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.51,0:13:21.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我到底在說些什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.27,0:13:25.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這點還是跟以前一樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.15,0:13:28.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以前在自由研究的發表時
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.15,0:13:31.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也是這樣熱情地介紹著古墳
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.61,0:13:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然都沒有人在聽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.24,0:13:37.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 好像是有這麼一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.49,0:13:42.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咦 你不是說已經不記得我了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.00,0:13:44.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是騙你的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.46,0:13:46.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,騙我的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.71,0:13:47.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 騙你的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.42,0:13:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.38,0:13:52.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.48,0:13:55.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是為什麼要說那種謊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.13,0:13:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.93,0:14:01.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎的睫毛真長啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.72,0:14:05.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,眼睛很大 眼白也很清透明亮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.02,0:14:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,頭髮也很柔軟飄逸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.52,0:14:10.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,與此相比 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島同學 你怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.99,0:14:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在班級裡也不起眼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.62,0:14:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且長相也不能單純用帥或者醜來形容
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.58,0:14:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總之就是無可評價也毫無個性
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:32.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為了成為稍微有點配得上高崎同學的男生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.17,0:14:34.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也調查了很多東西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.84,0:14:38.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也向仁阪請教了髮型和制服的穿法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.89,0:14:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且為了能和你上一個高中拚命學習
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.10,0:14:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,補習班的費用昂貴到父母都幾乎負擔不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.36,0:14:52.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咦 我到底在說些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.11,0:14:56.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總之 正是因為有你才有了現在的我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:14:59.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定要說 已經沒有時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明天也許政府通知會下達了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.33,0:15:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我喜歡你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:10.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,說了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.00,0:15:12.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我終於說了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.55,0:15:20.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.59,0:15:23.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.43,0:15:25.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還說沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.22,0:15:26.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.98,0:15:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我沒有考慮到你的心情 自說自話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.10,0:15:31.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算是被拒絕還是怎樣都好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唯獨不能讓高崎同學哭泣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.44,0:15:33.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,絕對不行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.32,0:15:37.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對 對了 我們班的竹田啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.32,0:15:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他最近在挑戰能不能用鼻子噴出鼻涕泡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.16,0:15:44.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島同學 你會不會已經忘記了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:56.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也一直一直喜歡著你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.30,0:16:02.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過 我真的沒想到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.97,0:16:05.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你還留著那塊橡皮擦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.47,0:16:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個時候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.18,0:16:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在第一節課就注意到我忘帶橡皮擦了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.98,0:16:15.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你 你怎麼知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.86,0:16:16.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就是知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.69,0:16:20.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是我第五節課才給你 是不是太遲了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.03,0:16:24.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 我很高興
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.41,0:16:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明明可以視而不見
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.79,0:16:32.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但一想到 你為我煩惱了一整天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.87,0:16:34.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就非常心動不已
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.17,0:16:35.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.55,0:16:40.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島同學很溫柔呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.72,0:16:43.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,溫 溫柔嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.34,0:16:45.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我認為你很溫柔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.39,0:16:51.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那時 你好不容易才鼓起勇氣幫助了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.89,0:16:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我認為 這就已經是非常非常美好的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.44,0:17:02.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,至少 對我而言是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.41,0:17:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼辦 快哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.28,0:17:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能和根島同學像這樣說話
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.00,0:17:13.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感覺好不可思議 好害羞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.55,0:17:19.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島同學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.05,0:17:20.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.05,0:17:22.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這五年來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.13,0:17:26.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,直到現在也一直喜歡你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.97,0:17:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想要永遠和你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.86,0:17:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.86,0:17:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喜歡上這個人真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.86,0:17:48.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我感覺我全身的細胞都在這樣訴說
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.75,0:17:54.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們來接吻吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.92,0:18:01.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,來接吻吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.64,0:18:14.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的喜歡是指
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.60,0:18:19.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想要接吻 和一起做很多很多事的喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.61,0:18:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島同學不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.61,0:18:25.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也是 我也是哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:18:58.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.86,0:19:05.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是什麼 我父母發來的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.36,0:19:11.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,政府通知
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.49,0:19:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎 我已經16了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.33,0:19:18.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不看嗎 信息
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.42,0:19:27.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,來自日本政府的重要通知
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.84,0:19:31.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根據你的個人情況及期望
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.51,0:19:34.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,演算...結果...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.51,0:19:39.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,決定了你的結婚對像
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.81,0:19:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,居住地
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.44,0:19:45.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,14日生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.19,0:19:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎美咲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.62,0:19:55.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學 發生奇跡了 這種事...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.04,0:19:58.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奇怪 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.66,0:20:02.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是根島由佳吏同學吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.46,0:20:07.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,晚上好我是厚生勞動省的一條
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.26,0:20:09.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是矢島
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.63,0:20:11.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,厚生勞動省
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.51,0:20:13.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是來下達政府通知的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.72,0:20:17.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很抱歉深夜來打擾你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.02,0:20:20.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恭喜訂婚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.44,0:20:23.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,多謝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.37,0:20:36.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真田莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.74,0:20:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剛剛我手機受到的通知信息裡不是這個名字
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.58,0:20:42.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,手機裡是這個女孩的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.04,0:20:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我認為那是不可能的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.04,0:20:46.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.00,0:20:49.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 在這種正式書面文件裡都這麼寫了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.13,0:20:51.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 的確出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.80,0:20:53.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她的名字在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.51,0:20:56.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也許是出什麼故障了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.55,0:20:58.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這份政府通知是絕對的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.85,0:20:59.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.60,0:21:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為你們都是未成年
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.19,0:21:07.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以請你們通過我們和女方進行初次聯絡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.03,0:21:12.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那麼 祝你能喜結良緣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.08,0:21:24.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他們也許是哪裡搞錯了 我們一起去...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.46,0:21:27.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,生日快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.21,0:21:33.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我 今天本來不打算來的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.84,0:21:40.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的心意也打算當做一輩子的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.52,0:21:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 你這是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.56,0:21:52.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以 能像這樣面對面說聲祝福
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.82,0:21:55.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也像是做夢一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.41,0:22:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我覺得我靠今天這30分鐘的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.66,0:22:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就能好好度過我未來的70年了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.84,0:22:13.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以根島同學也能這麼想的話 我會很高興的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.55,0:22:20.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學的手好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.14,0:22:22.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還顫抖著
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.73,0:22:28.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是的 高崎同學在撒謊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.02,0:22:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我 走了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.78,0:22:37.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.74,0:22:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即使在這個連結婚對象都要被他人所決定的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.70,0:22:46.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這樣不正常的世界裡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.58,0:22:49.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我這份喜歡的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.17,0:22:52.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也絕無虛假
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.51,0:22:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.85,0:23:07.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我喜歡高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.23,0:23:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的最喜歡你了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.66,0:23:30.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.05,0:23:35.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好奇怪的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.17,0:23:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島由佳吏 到底是個怎樣的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.01,0:23:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下回 渺小的謊言
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.80,0:23:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,預告全被你說完了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.68,0:23:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你到底是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.26,0:01:41.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}畫下等待的長線 這是心中小小的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.64,0:01:47.83,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}我們的未來 到底會走向何方呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:54.80,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}畫下連續的長線 接下來的旅途必定也耀眼奪目吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.29,0:02:00.36,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}就這樣 連接上心的旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.18,0:02:07.77,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷 悲傷 悲傷和悲傷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.84,0:02:14.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}快樂 快樂 快樂和快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:21.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}把兩份感傷的心疊放在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.57,0:02:28.45,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}看不清的未來裡誰才是該出場的配角
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.32,0:02:36.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}就這樣下去 即使是謊言也讓我把這美夢做完吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:42.01,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷地 悲傷地 現在就去尋找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:49.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}我們相信著看不見的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:54.69,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷地 悲傷地 去尋找著
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.44,0:02:56.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}現在就去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.48,0:22:25.48,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}剛才想說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.01,0:22:29.92,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}還沒能說出口
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.41,0:22:34.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}時間轉瞬即逝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.65,0:22:36.52,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}無暇許下心願
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.53,0:22:39.16,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}短暫夏日就此結束
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.37,0:22:49.84,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}別讓他發現 心聲難以克制
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.73,0:22:58.97,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}自然流露的靦腆表情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.97,0:23:03.05,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}掩藏不住心意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.77,0:23:07.56,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}兩人的溫度
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.80,0:23:12.88,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}歷經歲月 停留在此
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:14.68,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}在平淡的日子裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.68,0:23:17.16,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}時常回想起我們第一次的吻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.50,0:23:31.58,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}孤獨的夜裡 在夢中與你相會
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.48,0:22:25.48,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}さっきの言葉はまだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.48,0:22:27.80,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}I can't say I want to say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.01,0:22:29.92,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}言えないままでしまってる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.92,0:22:31.61,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}I always lie
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.41,0:22:34.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}星の瞬きほど早く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.65,0:22:36.52,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}願い事するひまも無く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.53,0:22:39.16,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}短い夏が終わってく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.16,0:22:40.78,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}I can't say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.68,0:22:44.43,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}Heart beat sound
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.37,0:22:49.84,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}気づかないでいてね高鳴る鼓動
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.22,0:22:54.27,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}Can't keep it to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.73,0:22:58.97,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}自然にこぼれたはにかむ顔が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.97,0:23:03.05,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}隠せないメッセージ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.66,0:23:05.77,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}I know why I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.77,0:23:07.56,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}未来を重ねた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.80,0:23:12.88,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}二人の温もりが ここに残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:14.68,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}ありふれた日々に
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.68,0:23:17.16,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}はじまりのキスを
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.50,0:23:31.58,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an7}ひとりの夜は 君の夢を見てた
